<% page_title "Reset Password" %>
<%= render "sessions/secondary_links" %>

<div id="c-password-resets">
  <div id="a-show">
    <div class="card mt-8 p-4 max-w-480px mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
      <h1 class="pb-4">Reset Password</h1>

      <%# Fork: 41chan keeps no email addresses (operator, 2026-11-07), so no reset link can be emailed. %>
      <p class="w-full">41chan keeps no email addresses, so a reset link can't be emailed to you.</p>

      <p class="w-full">If your booru account came with your 41chan Matrix account, or you have linked the two, open the booru while you're signed in to Matrix: you're signed in here too, and <strong>Settings &rarr; Change password</strong> takes a new password without the old one.</p>

      <p class="w-full">Otherwise, ask an administrator in the 41chan chat. They can send you a one-time link that shows you a new password, once.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
